            "sid": "HAB 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awu ni utenga uŵapocele jwakulocesya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Habakuku kutyocela kwa Mlungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kudandawula kwa Habakuku",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AMBUJE, ana timbe ndili mkwaŵenda cikamucisyo kwa ndaŵi jajilewu uli, wawojo mkinatukulupusye uwe ku yiwawa?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ana ligongo cici akusaka kuti nayiwoneje yisawusyo yamti myiyi? Ana ligongo cici akuyilecelela yangalumbanayi? Conasiko ni ngondo yisyungulile une, soni pana kumenyana ni kangana palipose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malamusi gamasile macili soni gangali masengo, nipo cilungamo cimasile. Ŵandu ŵakutenda yakusakala yikwajendela cenene kwapunda ŵandu ŵakulungamika, myoyo cilungamo cilepelece.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kwanga kwa AMBUJE",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaneko AMBUJE",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ŵatite kwa ŵandu ŵakwe, “Mjilolecesyeje mitundu ja ŵandu jijimsyungulile jemanja, timcisimonga ni yindu yitimciyiwona. Une tinjitenda yindu yele jemanja ngasimyikulupilila pa ndaŵi jitimciyipikana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.13.41"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mase 13:41",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngwakwesya soni Ababiloni kuŵa ŵamacili, mtundu wakogoya, ni wamacili. Jemanjaji akwawula mcilambo cosope capasi kuti akasumule malo gacimsyene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.24.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ayi 24:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵatendekasyaga ŵandu woga kulikose kuŵajawulaga, soni ŵalipaga ucimbicimbi ni kulipanganyicisya malamusi acimsyene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mahaci gawo gali gakuwutuka mnope kupunda yisuŵi, soni gakogoya kupunda masogo gagali ni sala. Acalume ŵakwela mahaci ŵayice kutyocela kwakutalika ali akwesile mahacigo. Ŵajendaga mpela nyanga jakusosa kamula nyama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Likuga lyawo lya ngondo likwika ni ciwawa, nipo ŵandu akutenda woga ndaŵi jakwika jemanjajo. Ŵakamulaga acikapolo ŵajinji mpela mcenga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵanyosyaga ayimwene nipo nduna ŵasisekaga. Ŵalisekaga lipupa lililyose lyakulicenjela, mwamti ŵawunjikaga litaka lyakwela ni kusumula msindawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaneko akusapita mwakwanguya mpela mbungo, ŵandu ŵele ŵamacili gawo gali mlungu jwawo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Habakuku akudandawula soni kwa AMBUJE",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AMBUJE, kutyocela pandanda wawo ali Mlungu. Wawo ali Mlungu jwangu, jwamswela ni jwangali mbesi. AMBUJE, Mlungu jwangu ni jwakundeteya, ŵalakwe ŵasagwile Ababiloni ni kwatendesya kuŵa ŵamacili kuti atupe uwe cilango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meso gawo gali geswela gangasosa kulola yakusakala, ngaŵa mkwalecelela kuti atendeje yangalumbana. Ana ligongo cici agambile kutama jii ni kwalolelaga jemanjajo ali mkwajonanga ŵandu ŵakulungamika kupunda acimsyenewo?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ana ligongo cici ŵatesile ŵandu kuŵa mpela somba sya m'nyasa kapena mpela yakwaŵa yele yayili yangali jwakuyilamulila? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amagongowo ŵakamulaga ŵandu pakwaloposyaga ni yisopo, mpela somba. Ŵawutilaga m'makoka gawo ni kusengwaga! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akusagapelecela mbopesi ni kugatutumicisya ubani",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " makoka gawo, ligongo makoka gawo gakusagatendesya kuŵa ni umi wapenani ni kulyaga cenene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ana tacipitilisya kamulisya masengo makoka gawo ni kuwulagaga mitundu ja ŵandu mwangali canasa mpaka kalakala?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
